{"sha": "d2858e97b3c17c559b9d56dbc08c73eb655ad97bb4e495764507b6da6db294f0", "body": ["\\chapter{Fractions: First Steps}\\label{ch:g6:fractions}", "", "把三个披萨公平地分给四个人，每人得到\\,\\dots\\", "不是整数个披萨。分数正是为“分配”而发明的数。", "本章建立分数的图像：分数作为整体的一部分，", "作为数轴上的一个点，以及", "除法的精确结果。", "", "\\section{分数的含义}", "", "\\begin{definition}[分数]\\label{def:g6:fractions:def}", "将一个单位平均分成 $b$ 份，取其中 $a$ 份，所得的量", "即为\\emph{分数}\\index{分数}：", "\\[", "\\frac{a}{b}", "\\qquad", "\\begin{array}{l}", "a \\text{：\\emph{分子} --- 取走的份数；}\\\\", "b \\text{：\\emph{分母} --- 单位被平均分成的份数。}", "\\end{array}", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.55]", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,3} \\draw[omExo] (\\i*2,0) rectangle (\\i*2+2,1.2);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,2} \\fill[omDef!40] (\\i*2+0.05,0.05)", "    rectangle (\\i*2+1.95,1.15);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (8,1.2);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (4,-0.15) {$\\frac34$ 的条形：平均分成", "  $4$ 份，取 $3$ 份};", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=11.5cm]", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,7} \\draw[omExo] (\\i,0) rectangle (\\i+1,1.2);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,4} \\fill[omThm!35] (\\i+0.05,0.05)", "    rectangle (\\i+0.95,1.15);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (8,1.2);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (4,-0.15) {$\\frac58$ 的条形：平均分成", "  $8$ 份，取 $5$ 份};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 同一条形的两个分数。分母说明切分得有多细，", "分子说明取了多少。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g6:fractions:morethanone}", "分数也可以大于 $1$：$\\frac74$ 表示七个四分之一 ---", "即一个整单位（四个四分之一）加上多出的三个四分之一：", "\\[", "\\frac74 = 1 + \\frac34 .", "\\]", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[数轴上的分数]\\label{prop:g6:fractions:line}", "要在数轴上标出 $\\frac ab$，只需将每个单位区间分成 $b$", "等份，数出 $a$ 份，从 $0$ 算起。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.5]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-0.2,0) -- (7.6,0);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,4,8,12,16,20,24,28}", "    \\draw ({\\i*0.25},-0.09) -- ({\\i*0.25},0.09);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,28} \\draw ({\\i*0.25},-0.05) -- ({\\i*0.25},0.05);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-0.1) {$0$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1,-0.1) {$1$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (2,-0.1) {$2$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (3,-0.1) {$3$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (4,-0.1) {$4$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (5,-0.1) {$5$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (6,-0.1) {$6$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (7,-0.1) {$7$};", "  \\fill[omDef] (0.75,0) circle (1.6pt)", "    node[above, font=\\small] {$\\frac34$};", "  \\fill[omThm] (1.75,0) circle (1.6pt)", "    node[above, font=\\small] {$\\frac74$};", "  \\fill[omMeth] (5.5,0) circle (1.6pt)", "    node[above, font=\\small] {$\\frac{22}{4}$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 数轴按四分之一刻度：$\\frac34$ 位于 $1$ 之前，", "$\\frac74$ 位于 $1$ 与 $2$ 之间，$\\frac{22}{4} = 5 + \\frac24$ 位于", "$5$ 与 $6$ 的正中间。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[分数即除法]\\label{thm:g6:fractions:quotient}", "分数 $\\frac ab$ 是这样一个数：乘以 $b$ 后", "得到 $a$：", "\\[", "\\frac ab \\times b = a .", "\\]", "换句话说，$\\frac ab$ 是 $a$ 除以 $b$ 的精确商 --- 即使", "除法“除不尽”时也是如此。", "\\end{theorem}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g6:fractions:pizzas}", "三个披萨分给四个人：每人得到 $\\frac34$ 个披萨。", "用定理验证：$4$ 份 $\\frac34$ 合起来为", "$\\frac34 \\times 4 = 3$ 个披萨。有些分数是小数", "（$\\frac34 = 0.75$），另一些则不是：$\\frac13 = 0.333\\dots$ 永远不会结束。", "分数是\\emph{精确}的值，$0.33$ 只是近似值。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{等值分数}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[等值分数]\\label{prop:g6:fractions:equal}", "当分数的分子与分母同时", "乘以（或除以）同一个非零数时，分数的值不变：", "\\[", "\\frac{a}{b} = \\frac{a \\times k}{b \\times k} .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", ""]}